# Short link handed to customers over WhatsApp / SMS — mgumrah.com/portal.
#
# Behind /portal sits a page (app/portal/page.tsx) that opens the visitor's own
# store with no second tap. It is held back until the Portal listings go live —
# jumping straight into a store that still lists the staff app would leave the
# customer installing the wrong thing. Delete the two lines below to switch the
# automatic jump on; nothing else needs to change.
#
# 302 rather than 301: browsers keep a permanent redirect for good, and this one
# is meant to be taken away again.
/portal                    /tr/apps/teknoportal/download/  302
/portal/                   /tr/apps/teknoportal/download/  302
/portal/en                 /en/apps/teknoportal/download/  301
/portal/en/                /en/apps/teknoportal/download/  301

